		<item>
		<title>美國阿公級旅行頑童走遍台灣，節目在美獲影視金獎[影]</title>
		<link>https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2020/05/29/%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b%e9%98%bf%e5%85%ac%e7%b4%9a%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e9%a0%91%e7%ab%a5%e8%b5%b0%e9%81%8d%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%ef%bc%8c%e7%af%80%e7%9b%ae%e5%9c%a8%e7%be%8e%e7%8d%b2%e5%bd%b1%e8%a6%96%e9%87%91/</link>
					<comments>https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2020/05/29/%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b%e9%98%bf%e5%85%ac%e7%b4%9a%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e9%a0%91%e7%ab%a5%e8%b5%b0%e9%81%8d%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%ef%bc%8c%e7%af%80%e7%9b%ae%e5%9c%a8%e7%be%8e%e7%8d%b2%e5%bd%b1%e8%a6%96%e9%87%91/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2020 19:59:24 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[焦點影音]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[美國新聞]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[台灣頭條]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[浮世繪]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[台美人台加人]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[台灣新聞]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[台灣人文藝術]]></category>
